    "chunk_text": "M\u00e6SSAN. Men \u00f0a leofestan, we magan hwylcum hwega wordum secggean be \u00f0\u00e6re arwyr\u00f0an gebyrdo & be \u00f0on W\u00e6s \u00f0\u00e6t Gode swi\u00f0e gecoren man on his d\u00e6dum. He w\u00e6s on Pannania \u00fe\u00e6re m\u00e6g\u00f0e \u00e6rest on woruld cumen, in Arrea \u00f0\u00e6m tune. W\u00e6s he hwe\u00f0re in Italia afeded in Ticinan \u00fe\u00e6re byrig. W\u00e6s he for worlde swi\u00fee \u00e6\u00feelra gebyrda & godra, w\u00e6ron his yldran hwe\u00f0re f\u00e6der & modor, buta W\u00e6s his f\u00e6der \u00e6rest cyninges \u00feegn, & \u00f0a \u00e6tnehstan ge\u00f0eah \u00fe\u00e6t he w\u00e6s cininges \u00feegna aldorman. \u00dea sceolde Sanctus Martinus nede beon on his geogo\u00f0hade on \u00f0\u00e6re gefer\u00e6denne cininges \u00f0egna, \u00e6rest N\u00e6s na \u00fe\u00e6t he his willan on \u00f0\u00e6m woruldfolga\u00f0e w\u00e6re; ah he sona on his geogo\u00f0e Godes \u00f0eowdom \u00dea he w\u00e6s tyn wintre, & hine hys yldran to woruldfolga\u00f0e tyhton ond l\u00e6rdan, \u00f0a fleah he to Godes & he \u00fea sona w\u00e6s wuldorlice mid eallum his life ymb Godes \u00feeowdom abisgod. \u00d0a he w\u00e6s fiftene wintre, \u00fea nyddon hine hys yldran to\u00f0\u00e6m \u00fe\u00e6t he sceolde woroldlicum w\u00e6pnum \u00dea w\u00e6s feower gear \u00e6r his fulwihte \u00fe\u00e6t he woroldw\u00e6pno w\u00e6g, & he hine hwe\u00f0re wi\u00f0 eallum \u00fe\u00e6m H\u00e6fde he miccle lufan & ealle w\u00e6rnesse to \u00e6lcum men, & he w\u00e6",
